{"id":"a3d2e8d14e47874b53fe83c2f39f0bb6b3efecd8","url":"https://unawatch.com/","title":"Meet UNA | The Modular GPS Watch","site_name":"Zeli","source":"Hacker News · 24h最热","byline":null,"excerpt":"The GPS Watch Built For Life. Designed to be sustainable, without the compromise in performance. Repairable. Upgradable. Sustainable.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><DIV tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"main\" id=\"MainContent\">\n      <div id=\"shopify-section-template--30361027969363__1783953073b248a5ad\">\r\n    <div>\r\n      \r\n        <picture>\r\n          <source media=\"(max-width: 749px)\" srcset=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Hero_Section_-_Mobile_9bd54221-84e5-4db2-ba63-d43035e4c28f.webp?v=1784044265&width=750\">\r\n          <source media=\"(min-width: 750px) and (max-width: 989px)\" srcset=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Hero_Section_-_test_tablet.webp?v=1784049505&width=1500\">\r\n          <img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Hero_Section_-_Desktop.webp?v=1783954861&width=2400\" srcset=\"\r\n              //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Hero_Section_-_Desktop.webp?v=1783954861&width=1500 1500w,\r\n              //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Hero_Section_-_Desktop.webp?v=1783954861&width=2400 2400w\r\n            \" sizes=\"100vw\" alt=\"GPS Watch\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"3200\" height=\"1380\">\r\n        </picture>\r\n      \r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n\r\n    <div>\r\n        \r\n          <h2>\r\n            \r\n              <span>THE GPS WATCH</span>\r\n            \r\n            \r\n              <span>BUILT FOR LIFE.</span>\r\n            \r\n          </h2>\r\n        \r\n\r\n        \r\n          <p>Repairable • Upgradeable • Sustainable</p>\r\n        \r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n        \r\n          \r\n        \r\n      </div>\r\n  </div><div data-speed=\"80\" id=\"shopify-section-template--30361027969363__una_main_text_slider_AzjT89\"><p>\n              6-axis Accelerometer\n            </p><p>\n              Dual Frequency GPS\n            </p><p>\n              Always ON HR Monitoring\n            </p><p>\n              USB-C Charging\n            </p><p>\n              Fully modular\n            </p><p>\n              10-day battery life\n            </p><p>\n              open sdk\n            </p><p>\n              barometric altimeter\n            </p></div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--30361027969363__1783957362b788d270\">\n\n    <div>\n\n      \n\n        <p>\n\n          WHY UNA EXISTS\n\n        </p>\n\n      \n\n      \n\n        <h2>\n\n          \n\n            <span>\n\n              When one part fails,\n\n            </span>\n\n          \n\n          \n\n            <span>\n\n              the whole watch shouldn't.\n\n            </span>\n\n          \n\n        </h2>\n\n      \n\n      \n\n        \n\n      \n\n      \n\n        <div>\n\n          \n\n            <p>Most smartwatches are sealed products. When the battery fades, a sensor fails, or support ends, the entire device is often replaced.</p>\n\n          \n\n          \n\n            <p>UNA is designed around a different idea: a GPS Watch you can repair, upgrade and keep.</p>\n\n          \n\n        </div>\n\n      \n\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n\n        \n\n          <picture>\n\n            \n\n            <img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/DSC05249.jpg?v=1783695266&width=1600\" srcset=\"\n\n                //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/DSC05249.jpg?v=1783695266&width=600 600w,\n\n                //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/DSC05249.jpg?v=1783695266&width=900 900w,\n\n                //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/DSC05249.jpg?v=1783695266&width=1300 1300w,\n\n                //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/DSC05249.jpg?v=1783695266&width=1600 1600w\n\n              \" sizes=\"\n\n                (max-width: 749px) 100vw,\n\n                (max-width: 1199px) 100vw,\n\n                650px\n\n              \" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2307\" height=\"1538\">\n\n          </picture>\n\n        \n\n        \n\n      </div>\n\n  </div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--30361027969363__17839363314c305bfd\">\n    <div>\n      \n        <h2>\n          A New Era\n        </h2>\n      \n      \n        <h2>\n          Of Battery\n        </h2>\n      \n      \n        <p>\n          UNA features a 280 mAh hard-shell battery that can be replaced with a single screwdriver. This battery is the first of its kind in wearables.\n        </p>\n      \n    </div>\n    <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/TL_-_2_Watches_Air_3_-_Edited_818bf33e-30b7-4d1a-9697-caedaebcff7f.png?v=1783937263&width=1200\" srcset=\"\n            //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/TL_-_2_Watches_Air_3_-_Edited_818bf33e-30b7-4d1a-9697-caedaebcff7f.png?v=1783937263&width=400 400w,\n            //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/TL_-_2_Watches_Air_3_-_Edited_818bf33e-30b7-4d1a-9697-caedaebcff7f.png?v=1783937263&width=700 700w,\n            //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/TL_-_2_Watches_Air_3_-_Edited_818bf33e-30b7-4d1a-9697-caedaebcff7f.png?v=1783937263&width=900 900w,\n            //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/TL_-_2_Watches_Air_3_-_Edited_818bf33e-30b7-4d1a-9697-caedaebcff7f.png?v=1783937263&width=1200 1200w\n          \" sizes=\"\n            (max-width: 749px) 80vw,\n            (max-width: 1199px) 42vw,\n            580px\n          \" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1750\">\n      \n    </p>\n    <div>\n      \n        <h2>\n          Charges With\n        </h2>\n      \n      \n        <h2>\n          USB Type-C\n        </h2>\n      \n      \n        <p>\n          Gone are the days of brand specific\ncharging cables. UNA features a\nuniversal IP68 rated usb-c charging\ncable - the same as your phone.\n        </p>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--30361027969363__1783703803857114da\">\n\n\n\n\n\n<feature-carousel-arvfvdk9usenwnll5naigenblock0348825zmpfje data-auto-scroll=\"false\" data-auto-scroll-speed=\"10\">\n  <div>\n    \n      \n\n      \n        <div data-carousel-card=\"\">\n          <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Scroll_Features_-_Repair_Upgrade.png?v=1783706425&width=600\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1000\" height=\"545\">\n            \n          </p>\n\n          <div>\n            \n              <h3>\n                REPAIRABLE &amp; UPGRADEABLE\n              </h3>\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n              <p>\n                The first wearable of its kind to give users easy access to all of the watch internals. This means replacing a cracked screen or a dead battery is easier than ever.\n              </p>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n      \n    \n      \n\n      \n        <div data-carousel-card=\"\">\n          <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Scroll_Features_-_Run_ride_and_hike.png?v=1783706425&width=600\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1000\" height=\"545\">\n            \n          </p>\n\n          <div>\n            \n              <h3>\n                TRACK YOUR RUNS, RIDES &amp; HIKES\n              </h3>\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n              <p>\n                UNA keeps things simple, with a clear focus on tracking your activities without the fluff. This means more adventures and less frustration.\n              </p>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n      \n    \n      \n\n      \n        <div data-carousel-card=\"\">\n          <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Scroll_Features_-_Strava.png?v=1783706425&width=600\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1000\" height=\"545\">\n            \n          </p>\n\n          <div>\n            \n              <h3>\n                SEAMLESSLY SYNCS TO STRAVA\n              </h3>\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n              <p>\n                Once you've completed your activity, simply connect your watch to the UNA mobile app and your activity will quickly sync to Strava.\n              </p>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n      \n    \n      \n\n      \n        <div data-carousel-card=\"\">\n          <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Scroll_Features_-_Dev_Platform.png?v=1783706424&width=600\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1000\" height=\"545\">\n            \n          </p>\n\n          <div>\n            \n              <h3>\n                OPEN DEVELOPER PLATFORM\n              </h3>\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n              <p>\n                UNA gives developers access to the tools, data and sensors needed to build custom apps and experiences.\n              </p>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n      \n    \n      \n\n      \n        <div data-carousel-card=\"\">\n          <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/App.png?v=1784045630&width=600\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1000\" height=\"545\">\n            \n          </p>\n\n          <div>\n            \n              <h3>\n                UNA MOBILE APP\n              </h3>\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n              <p>\n                UNA pairs with easy-to-use application available on both iOS &amp; Android that unlocks even more features.\n              </p>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n      \n    \n  </div>\n\n  \n    \n  \n</feature-carousel-arvfvdk9usenwnll5naigenblock0348825zmpfje>\n\n\n\n</div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--30361027969363__1783940631ac60374d\">\n      \n        <h2>\n          \n            An open-source wearable\nthat is designed to be\n<span>owned 100% by you.</span>\n          \n        </h2>\n      \n\n      <div>\n        \n          <h3>BUILD APPS &amp; FEATURES FOR UNA WATCH</h3>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          <p>Using our bespoke SDK, users can create a vast array of activities, utilities and glances with ease. All whilst having unfiltered access to the watch.</p>\n        \n\n        \n          <p><a href=\"https://www.developers.unawatch.com/latest/\">\n            VISIT OUR SDK\n          </a>\n        \n      </p></div>\n    </div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--30361027969363__1782940279f0ac537a\">\n      \n        \n\n        <div>\n          \n            <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/techradar-15-logo-marketo-white_1.png?v=1783614572&width=440\" alt=\"Brand logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"274\" height=\"75\">\n              \n            </p>\n          \n        </div>\n      \n        \n\n        <div>\n          \n            <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Clip_path_group.png?v=1783614574&width=440\" alt=\"Brand logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"135\" height=\"32\">\n              \n            </p>\n          \n        </div>\n      \n        \n\n        <div>\n          \n            <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/DT_Logo.png?v=1783614572&width=440\" alt=\"Brand logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"184\" height=\"33\">\n              \n            </p>\n          \n        </div>\n      \n        \n\n        <div>\n          \n            <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Layer_2.png?v=1783614574&width=440\" alt=\"Brand logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"316\" height=\"32\">\n              \n            </p>\n          \n        </div>\n      \n        \n\n        <div>\n          \n            <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/idNcnbAbPQ_1782383835432_2.png?v=1783614573&width=440\" alt=\"Brand logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"141\" height=\"32\">\n              \n            </p>\n          \n        </div>\n      \n    </div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--30361027969363__1783615036d48b2908\">\n  <div>\n    \n      <picture>\n        \n\n        <img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Email_push_1443cdb0-ca95-41c3-b79a-c5b6c06bbe99.png?v=1783965410&width=2400\" srcset=\"\n            //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Email_push_1443cdb0-ca95-41c3-b79a-c5b6c06bbe99.png?v=1783965410&width=800 800w,\n            //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Email_push_1443cdb0-ca95-41c3-b79a-c5b6c06bbe99.png?v=1783965410&width=1200 1200w,\n            //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Email_push_1443cdb0-ca95-41c3-b79a-c5b6c06bbe99.png?v=1783965410&width=1600 1600w,\n            //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Email_push_1443cdb0-ca95-41c3-b79a-c5b6c06bbe99.png?v=1783965410&width=2000 2000w,\n            //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Email_push_1443cdb0-ca95-41c3-b79a-c5b6c06bbe99.png?v=1783965410&width=2400 2400w\n          \" sizes=\"(min-width: 750px) 140vw, 100vw\" alt=\"Three UNA GPS watches\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2400\" height=\"850\">\n      </picture>\n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div>\n    \n      <p>\n        DESIGNED TO LAST\n      </p>\n    \n\n    \n      <h2>\n        \n          \n\n          \n            <span>BASED IN SCOTLAND,</span> UNA WAS BUILT FROM THE GROUND UP BY A TEAM OF TALENTED ENGINEERS WHO GREW TIRED OF THE LACK OF SUSTAINABILITY IN THE TECH WE USE TODAY.\n          \n        \n      </h2>\n    \n\n    \n      \n    \n\n    \n      \n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n    </DIV></DIV>","content_text":"THE GPS WATCH BUILT FOR LIFE. Repairable • Upgradeable • Sustainable 6-axis Accelerometer Dual Frequency GPS Always ON HR Monitoring USB-C Charging Fully modular 10-day battery life open sdk barometric altimeter WHY UNA EXISTS When one part fails, the whole watch shouldn't. Most smartwatches are sealed products. When the battery fades, a sensor fails, or support ends, the entire device is often replaced. UNA is designed around a different idea: a GPS Watch you can repair, upgrade and keep. A New Era Of Battery UNA features a 280 mAh hard-shell battery that can be replaced with a single screwdriver. This battery is the first of its kind in wearables. Charges With USB Type-C Gone are the days of brand specific charging cables. UNA features a universal IP68 rated usb-c charging cable - the same as your phone. REPAIRABLE & UPGRADEABLE The first wearable of its kind to give users easy access to all of the watch internals. This means replacing a cracked screen or a dead battery is easier than ever. TRACK YOUR RUNS, RIDES & HIKES UNA keeps things simple, with a clear focus on tracking your activities without the fluff. This means more adventures and less frustration. SEAMLESSLY SYNCS TO STRAVA Once you've completed your activity, simply connect your watch to the UNA mobile app and your activity will quickly sync to Strava. OPEN DEVELOPER PLATFORM UNA gives developers access to the tools, data and sensors needed to build custom apps and experiences. UNA MOBILE APP UNA pairs with easy-to-use application available on both iOS & Android that unlocks even more features. An open-source wearable that is designed to be owned 100% by you. BUILD APPS & FEATURES FOR UNA WATCH Using our bespoke SDK, users can create a vast array of activities, utilities and glances with ease. All whilst having unfiltered access to the watch. VISIT OUR SDK DESIGNED TO LAST BASED IN SCOTLAND, UNA WAS BUILT FROM THE GROUND UP BY A TEAM OF TALENTED ENGINEERS WHO GREW TIRED OF THE LACK OF SUSTAINABILITY IN THE TECH WE USE TODAY.","fetched_at":"2026-07-29T12:46:44.510Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<h2>\r\n            \r\n              <span>THE GPS WATCH</span>\r\n            \r\n            \r\n              <span>BUILT FOR LIFE.</span>\r\n            \r\n          </h2>","sentences":[{"en":"THE GPS WATCH BUILT FOR LIFE.","zh":"专为生活打造的 GPS 手表。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Repairable • Upgradeable • Sustainable</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Repairable • Upgradeable • Sustainable","zh":"可修复 • 可升级 • 可持续"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n              6-axis Accelerometer\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"6-axis Accelerometer","zh":"6轴加速度计"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n              Dual Frequency GPS\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Dual Frequency GPS","zh":"双频GPS"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n              Always ON HR Monitoring\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Always ON HR Monitoring","zh":"始终开启心率监测"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n              USB-C Charging\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"USB-C Charging","zh":"USB-C 充电"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n              Fully modular\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Fully modular","zh":"完全模块化"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n              10-day battery life\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"10-day battery life","zh":"10 天的电池寿命"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n              open sdk\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"open sdk","zh":"打开SDK"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n              barometric altimeter\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"barometric altimeter","zh":"气压高度计"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n\n          WHY UNA EXISTS\n\n        </p>","sentences":[{"en":"WHY UNA EXISTS","zh":"尤娜为何存在"}]},{"html_en":"<h2>\n\n          \n\n            <span>\n\n              When one part fails,\n\n            </span>\n\n          \n\n          \n\n            <span>\n\n              the whole watch shouldn't.\n\n            </span>\n\n          \n\n        </h2>","sentences":[{"en":"When one part fails, the whole watch shouldn't.","zh":"当一个部件出现故障时，整个手表应该不会出现故障。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Most smartwatches are sealed products. When the battery fades, a sensor fails, or support ends, the entire device is often replaced.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Most smartwatches are sealed products.","zh":"大多数智能手表都是密封产品。"},{"en":"When the battery fades, a sensor fails, or support ends, the entire device is often replaced.","zh":"当电池电量耗尽、传感器发生故障或支持终止时，通常会更换整个设备。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>UNA is designed around a different idea: a GPS Watch you can repair, upgrade and keep.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"UNA is designed around a different idea: a GPS Watch you can repair, upgrade and keep.","zh":"UNA 的设计理念不同：一款可以维修、升级和保留的 GPS 手表。"}]},{"html_en":"<h2>\n          A New Era\n        </h2>","sentences":[{"en":"A New Era","zh":"在新时代"}]},{"html_en":"<h2>\n          Of Battery\n        </h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Of Battery","zh":"电池数量"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n          UNA features a 280 mAh hard-shell battery that can be replaced with a single screwdriver. This battery is the first of its kind in wearables.\n        </p>","sentences":[{"en":"UNA features a 280 mAh hard-shell battery that can be replaced with a single screwdriver.","zh":"UNA 配备 280 mAh 硬壳电池，可用一把螺丝刀即可更换。"},{"en":"This battery is the first of its kind in wearables.","zh":"该电池是可穿戴设备中的首款此类电池。"}]},{"html_en":"<h2>\n          Charges With\n        </h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Charges With","zh":"收费与"}]},{"html_en":"<h2>\n          USB Type-C\n        </h2>","sentences":[{"en":"USB Type-C","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n          Gone are the days of brand specific\ncharging cables. UNA features a\nuniversal IP68 rated usb-c charging\ncable - the same as your phone.\n        </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Gone are the days of brand specific charging cables.","zh":"品牌专用充电线的时代已经一去不复返了。"},{"en":"UNA features a universal IP68 rated usb-c charging cable - the same as your phone.","zh":"UNA 配备通用 IP68 级 USB-C 充电线 - 与您的手机相同。"}]},{"html_en":"<h3>\n                REPAIRABLE &amp; UPGRADEABLE\n              </h3>","sentences":[{"en":"REPAIRABLE & UPGRADEABLE","zh":"可修复和可升级"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n                The first wearable of its kind to give users easy access to all of the watch internals. This means replacing a cracked screen or a dead battery is easier than ever.\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"The first wearable of its kind to give users easy access to all of the watch internals.","zh":"同类首款可穿戴设备，让用户可以轻松访问手表的所有内部结构。"},{"en":"This means replacing a cracked screen or a dead battery is easier than ever.","zh":"这意味着更换破裂的屏幕或没电的电池比以往任何时候都更容易。"}]},{"html_en":"<h3>\n                TRACK YOUR RUNS, RIDES &amp; HIKES\n              </h3>","sentences":[{"en":"TRACK YOUR RUNS, RIDES & HIKES","zh":"追踪您的跑步、骑行和远足"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n                UNA keeps things simple, with a clear focus on tracking your activities without the fluff. This means more adventures and less frustration.\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"UNA keeps things simple, with a clear focus on tracking your activities without the fluff.","zh":"UNA 让事情变得简单，明确地专注于跟踪您的活动，没有任何多余的内容。"},{"en":"This means more adventures and less frustration.","zh":"这意味着更多的冒险和更少的挫折。"}]},{"html_en":"<h3>\n                SEAMLESSLY SYNCS TO STRAVA\n              </h3>","sentences":[{"en":"SEAMLESSLY SYNCS TO STRAVA","zh":"无缝同步至 Strava"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n                Once you've completed your activity, simply connect your watch to the UNA mobile app and your activity will quickly sync to Strava.\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Once you've completed your activity, simply connect your watch to the UNA mobile app and your activity will quickly sync to Strava.","zh":"完成活动后，只需将手表连接到 UNA 移动应用程序，您的活动就会快速同步到 Strava。"}]},{"html_en":"<h3>\n                OPEN DEVELOPER PLATFORM\n              </h3>","sentences":[{"en":"OPEN DEVELOPER PLATFORM","zh":"开放的开发者平台"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n                UNA gives developers access to the tools, data and sensors needed to build custom apps and experiences.\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"UNA gives developers access to the tools, data and sensors needed to build custom apps and experiences.","zh":"UNA 使开发人员能够访问构建自定义应用程序和体验所需的工具、数据和传感器。"}]},{"html_en":"<h3>\n                UNA MOBILE APP\n              </h3>","sentences":[{"en":"UNA MOBILE APP","zh":"移动应用程序"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n                UNA pairs with easy-to-use application available on both iOS &amp; Android that unlocks even more features.\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"UNA pairs with easy-to-use application available on both iOS & Android that unlocks even more features.","zh":"UNA 与 iOS 和 Android 上可用的易于使用的应用程序配对，可解锁更多功能。"}]},{"html_en":"<h2>\n          \n            An open-source wearable\nthat is designed to be\n<span>owned 100% by you.</span>\n          \n        </h2>","sentences":[{"en":"An open-source wearable that is designed to be owned 100% by you.","zh":"一款开源可穿戴设备，旨在让您 100% 拥有所有权。"}]},{"html_en":"<h3>BUILD APPS &amp; FEATURES FOR UNA WATCH</h3>","sentences":[{"en":"BUILD APPS & FEATURES FOR UNA WATCH","zh":"为 UNA WATCH 构建应用程序和功能"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Using our bespoke SDK, users can create a vast array of activities, utilities and glances with ease. All whilst having unfiltered access to the watch.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Using our bespoke SDK, users can create a vast array of activities, utilities and glances with ease.","zh":"使用我们的定制 SDK，用户可以轻松创建大量活动、实用程序和概览。"},{"en":"All whilst having unfiltered access to the watch.","zh":"同时可以不经过滤地访问手表。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><a href=\"https://www.developers.unawatch.com/latest/\">\n            VISIT OUR SDK\n          </a>\n        \n      </p>","sentences":[{"en":"VISIT OUR SDK","zh":"访问我们的 SDK"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n        DESIGNED TO LAST\n      </p>","sentences":[{"en":"DESIGNED TO LAST","zh":"经久耐用的设计"}]},{"html_en":"<h2>\n        \n          \n\n          \n            <span>BASED IN SCOTLAND,</span> UNA WAS BUILT FROM THE GROUND UP BY A TEAM OF TALENTED ENGINEERS WHO GREW TIRED OF THE LACK OF SUSTAINABILITY IN THE TECH WE USE TODAY.\n          \n        \n      </h2>","sentences":[{"en":"BASED IN SCOTLAND, UNA WAS BUILT FROM THE GROUND UP BY A TEAM OF TALENTED ENGINEERS WHO GREW TIRED OF THE LACK OF SUSTAINABILITY IN THE TECH WE USE TODAY.","zh":"UNA 总部位于苏格兰，由一群才华横溢的工程师团队白手起家，他们厌倦了我们当今使用的技术缺乏可持续性。"}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"main\" id=\"MainContent\">\n      <div id=\"shopify-section-template--30361027969363__1783953073b248a5ad\">\r\n    <div>\r\n      \r\n        <picture>\r\n          <source media=\"(max-width: 749px)\" srcset=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Hero_Section_-_Mobile_9bd54221-84e5-4db2-ba63-d43035e4c28f.webp?v=1784044265&width=750\">\r\n          <source media=\"(min-width: 750px) and (max-width: 989px)\" srcset=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Hero_Section_-_test_tablet.webp?v=1784049505&width=1500\">\r\n          <img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Hero_Section_-_Desktop.webp?v=1783954861&width=2400\" srcset=\"\r\n              //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Hero_Section_-_Desktop.webp?v=1783954861&width=1500 1500w,\r\n              //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Hero_Section_-_Desktop.webp?v=1783954861&width=2400 2400w\r\n            \" sizes=\"100vw\" alt=\"GPS Watch\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"3200\" height=\"1380\">\r\n        </picture>\r\n      \r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n\r\n    <div>\r\n        \r\n          <h2>专为生活打造的 GPS 手表。</h2>\r\n        \r\n\r\n        \r\n          <p>可修复 • 可升级 • 可持续</p>\r\n        \r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n        \r\n          \r\n        \r\n      </div>\r\n  </div><div data-speed=\"80\" id=\"shopify-section-template--30361027969363__una_main_text_slider_AzjT89\"><p>6轴加速度计</p><p>双频GPS</p><p>始终开启心率监测</p><p>USB-C 充电</p><p>完全模块化</p><p>10 天的电池寿命</p><p>打开SDK</p><p>气压高度计</p></div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--30361027969363__1783957362b788d270\">\n\n    <div>\n\n      \n\n        <p>尤娜为何存在</p>\n\n      \n\n      \n\n        <h2>当一个部件出现故障时，整个手表应该不会出现故障。</h2>\n\n      \n\n      \n\n        \n\n      \n\n      \n\n        <div>\n\n          \n\n            <p>大多数智能手表都是密封产品。 当电池电量耗尽、传感器发生故障或支持终止时，通常会更换整个设备。</p>\n\n          \n\n          \n\n            <p>UNA 的设计理念不同：一款可以维修、升级和保留的 GPS 手表。</p>\n\n          \n\n        </div>\n\n      \n\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n\n        \n\n          <picture>\n\n            \n\n            <img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/DSC05249.jpg?v=1783695266&width=1600\" srcset=\"\n\n                //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/DSC05249.jpg?v=1783695266&width=600 600w,\n\n                //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/DSC05249.jpg?v=1783695266&width=900 900w,\n\n                //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/DSC05249.jpg?v=1783695266&width=1300 1300w,\n\n                //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/DSC05249.jpg?v=1783695266&width=1600 1600w\n\n              \" sizes=\"\n\n                (max-width: 749px) 100vw,\n\n                (max-width: 1199px) 100vw,\n\n                650px\n\n              \" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2307\" height=\"1538\">\n\n          </picture>\n\n        \n\n        \n\n      </div>\n\n  </div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--30361027969363__17839363314c305bfd\">\n    <div>\n      \n        <h2>在新时代</h2>\n      \n      \n        <h2>电池数量</h2>\n      \n      \n        <p>UNA 配备 280 mAh 硬壳电池，可用一把螺丝刀即可更换。 该电池是可穿戴设备中的首款此类电池。</p>\n      \n    </div>\n    <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/TL_-_2_Watches_Air_3_-_Edited_818bf33e-30b7-4d1a-9697-caedaebcff7f.png?v=1783937263&width=1200\" srcset=\"\n            //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/TL_-_2_Watches_Air_3_-_Edited_818bf33e-30b7-4d1a-9697-caedaebcff7f.png?v=1783937263&width=400 400w,\n            //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/TL_-_2_Watches_Air_3_-_Edited_818bf33e-30b7-4d1a-9697-caedaebcff7f.png?v=1783937263&width=700 700w,\n            //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/TL_-_2_Watches_Air_3_-_Edited_818bf33e-30b7-4d1a-9697-caedaebcff7f.png?v=1783937263&width=900 900w,\n            //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/TL_-_2_Watches_Air_3_-_Edited_818bf33e-30b7-4d1a-9697-caedaebcff7f.png?v=1783937263&width=1200 1200w\n          \" sizes=\"\n            (max-width: 749px) 80vw,\n            (max-width: 1199px) 42vw,\n            580px\n          \" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1750\">\n      \n    </p>\n    <div>\n      \n        <h2>收费与</h2>\n      \n      \n        <h2>USB Type-C</h2>\n      \n      \n        <p>品牌专用充电线的时代已经一去不复返了。 UNA 配备通用 IP68 级 USB-C 充电线 - 与您的手机相同。</p>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--30361027969363__1783703803857114da\">\n\n\n\n\n\n<feature-carousel-arvfvdk9usenwnll5naigenblock0348825zmpfje data-auto-scroll=\"false\" data-auto-scroll-speed=\"10\">\n  <div>\n    \n      \n\n      \n        <div data-carousel-card=\"\">\n          <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Scroll_Features_-_Repair_Upgrade.png?v=1783706425&width=600\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1000\" height=\"545\">\n            \n          </p>\n\n          <div>\n            \n              <h3>可修复和可升级</h3>\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n              <p>同类首款可穿戴设备，让用户可以轻松访问手表的所有内部结构。 这意味着更换破裂的屏幕或没电的电池比以往任何时候都更容易。</p>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n      \n    \n      \n\n      \n        <div data-carousel-card=\"\">\n          <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Scroll_Features_-_Run_ride_and_hike.png?v=1783706425&width=600\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1000\" height=\"545\">\n            \n          </p>\n\n          <div>\n            \n              <h3>追踪您的跑步、骑行和远足</h3>\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n              <p>UNA 让事情变得简单，明确地专注于跟踪您的活动，没有任何多余的内容。 这意味着更多的冒险和更少的挫折。</p>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n      \n    \n      \n\n      \n        <div data-carousel-card=\"\">\n          <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Scroll_Features_-_Strava.png?v=1783706425&width=600\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1000\" height=\"545\">\n            \n          </p>\n\n          <div>\n            \n              <h3>无缝同步至 Strava</h3>\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n              <p>完成活动后，只需将手表连接到 UNA 移动应用程序，您的活动就会快速同步到 Strava。</p>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n      \n    \n      \n\n      \n        <div data-carousel-card=\"\">\n          <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Scroll_Features_-_Dev_Platform.png?v=1783706424&width=600\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1000\" height=\"545\">\n            \n          </p>\n\n          <div>\n            \n              <h3>开放的开发者平台</h3>\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n              <p>UNA 使开发人员能够访问构建自定义应用程序和体验所需的工具、数据和传感器。</p>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n      \n    \n      \n\n      \n        <div data-carousel-card=\"\">\n          <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/App.png?v=1784045630&width=600\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1000\" height=\"545\">\n            \n          </p>\n\n          <div>\n            \n              <h3>移动应用程序</h3>\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n              <p>UNA 与 iOS 和 Android 上可用的易于使用的应用程序配对，可解锁更多功能。</p>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n      \n    \n  </div>\n\n  \n    \n  \n</feature-carousel-arvfvdk9usenwnll5naigenblock0348825zmpfje>\n\n\n\n</div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--30361027969363__1783940631ac60374d\">\n      \n        <h2>一款开源可穿戴设备，旨在让您 100% 拥有所有权。</h2>\n      \n\n      <div>\n        \n          <h3>为 UNA WATCH 构建应用程序和功能</h3>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          <p>使用我们的定制 SDK，用户可以轻松创建大量活动、实用程序和概览。 同时可以不经过滤地访问手表。</p>\n        \n\n        \n          <p>访问我们的 SDK</p></div>\n    </div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--30361027969363__1782940279f0ac537a\">\n      \n        \n\n        <div>\n          \n            <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/techradar-15-logo-marketo-white_1.png?v=1783614572&width=440\" alt=\"Brand logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"274\" height=\"75\">\n              \n            </p>\n          \n        </div>\n      \n        \n\n        <div>\n          \n            <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Clip_path_group.png?v=1783614574&width=440\" alt=\"Brand logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"135\" height=\"32\">\n              \n            </p>\n          \n        </div>\n      \n        \n\n        <div>\n          \n            <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/DT_Logo.png?v=1783614572&width=440\" alt=\"Brand logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"184\" height=\"33\">\n              \n            </p>\n          \n        </div>\n      \n        \n\n        <div>\n          \n            <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Layer_2.png?v=1783614574&width=440\" alt=\"Brand logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"316\" height=\"32\">\n              \n            </p>\n          \n        </div>\n      \n        \n\n        <div>\n          \n            <p><img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/idNcnbAbPQ_1782383835432_2.png?v=1783614573&width=440\" alt=\"Brand logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"141\" height=\"32\">\n              \n            </p>\n          \n        </div>\n      \n    </div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--30361027969363__1783615036d48b2908\">\n  <div>\n    \n      <picture>\n        \n\n        <img src=\"//unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Email_push_1443cdb0-ca95-41c3-b79a-c5b6c06bbe99.png?v=1783965410&width=2400\" srcset=\"\n            //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Email_push_1443cdb0-ca95-41c3-b79a-c5b6c06bbe99.png?v=1783965410&width=800 800w,\n            //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Email_push_1443cdb0-ca95-41c3-b79a-c5b6c06bbe99.png?v=1783965410&width=1200 1200w,\n            //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Email_push_1443cdb0-ca95-41c3-b79a-c5b6c06bbe99.png?v=1783965410&width=1600 1600w,\n            //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Email_push_1443cdb0-ca95-41c3-b79a-c5b6c06bbe99.png?v=1783965410&width=2000 2000w,\n            //unawatch.com/cdn/shop/files/Email_push_1443cdb0-ca95-41c3-b79a-c5b6c06bbe99.png?v=1783965410&width=2400 2400w\n          \" sizes=\"(min-width: 750px) 140vw, 100vw\" alt=\"Three UNA GPS watches\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2400\" height=\"850\">\n      </picture>\n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div>\n    \n      <p>经久耐用的设计</p>\n    \n\n    \n      <h2>UNA 总部位于苏格兰，由一群才华横溢的工程师团队白手起家，他们厌倦了我们当今使用的技术缺乏可持续性。</h2>\n    \n\n    \n      \n    \n\n    \n      \n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n    </div></div>"}